; Break at the single funnel every ExitProcess goes through and dump the caller.
; Use with:  cdb -G -cf 01-exit-stack.cdb <chrome.exe> --headless=new ...
;
; ntdll is used instead of KERNELBASE because KERNELBASE is not loaded yet when
; the -cf script runs, so `bp KERNELBASE!ExitProcess` fails to resolve and cdb
; reports "Couldn't resolve error".
bp ntdll!RtlExitUserProcess "kb 45; q"
g
